---
import Base from "@layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Arkivest - Website siap konversi untuk usaha yang serius";
const description =
  "Web studio Indonesia. Bangun website, dashboard, dan e-commerce custom untuk UKM yang serius. Security dipraktikkan, SEO terukur, kode yang dipikirkan. Mulai Rp5jt.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} lang="id">
  <section class="relative pt-40 lg:pt-48">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-mono text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">
        Arkivest Studio · Tangerang, ID
      </p>
      <h1
        class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-display-2 font-semibold tracking-tight lg:text-display-1"
      >
        Website siap konversi untuk usaha yang
        <span class="text-signal">serius</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-ink/70">
        Bukan template generic. Bukan jualan tagline. Code yang dipikirkan,
        security yang dipraktikkan, SEO yang terukur. Bukti karya: Wearscrubs.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-body-sm font-medium text-paper transition hover:bg-signal"
        >
          Diskusi project
        </a>
        <a
          href="/work"
          class="rounded-full border border-line px-6 py-3 text-body-sm font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-ink"
        >
          Lihat karya
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-mono text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">
        Pilar
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Tiga hal yang tidak boleh kompromi.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
        <article class="md:col-span-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-caption text-signal">01 / Security</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-h3 font-semibold">Dipraktikkan, bukan dipajang.</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink/70">
            Row-Level Security, JWT + bcrypt, rate limiter login, bucket privat
            dengan signed URL, anti-tamper harga server-side. Standar Wearscrubs,
            standar setiap project Arkivest.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-caption text-signal">02 / SEO</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-h3 font-semibold">Terukur sampai meta description.</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink/70">
            Title unik, structured data, hreflang ID-EN, sitemap auto, OG image
            berbranding. Bukan checklist plugin. Setiap halaman dibuat untuk
            dapat traffic, bukan sekedar dipublish.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="md:col-span-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-caption text-signal">03 / Logic</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-h3 font-semibold">Kode yang dipikirkan.</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink/70">
            Transaksi atomik, validasi server-side, alur bisnis yang dimodelkan
            sesuai realita. Kalau admin Anda istri yang sibuk anak, dashboard
            harus bisa dipakai tanpa training. Itu ukuran kami.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-paper-2">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">
            Showcase
          </p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">
            Wearscrubs - dari spreadsheet ke toko hidup.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/work/wearscrubs"
          class="font-mono text-body-sm font-medium text-signal hover:underline"
        >
          Baca case study →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[3fr_2fr]">
        <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-3xl bg-ink"></div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-caption text-muted">Stack</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body">Astro + Node + Supabase + Railway</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-caption text-muted">Live</p>
            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-body">wearscrubs.id</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-caption text-muted">Hasil</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body">
              Dashboard intuitif untuk admin non-teknis, RLS 11 tabel, bucket
              privat, ongkir 5 zona, alur PO + custom size.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center lg:px-10">
      <h2 class="text-h1 font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Punya produk, butuh website yang serius?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-body-lg text-ink/70">
        Mulai Rp5jt. Timeline jelas. Kode jadi milik Anda.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-full bg-signal px-8 py-4 text-body font-medium text-signal-fg transition hover:bg-ink"
      >
        Diskusi project
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
